# The Skullspore Nexus: "create a green Fungus Dinosaur creature token with base power and toughness each equal to the total power of those
# creatures". A calculation that needs a negative value uses it (CR 107.1b), so a creature with negative power takes from the total rather
# than adding 0. Bot1 controls only Arboreal Grazer (0/3), so the Nexus costs the full {6}{G}{G} on turn 3. On turn 5 Bot1 casts Llanowar Elves;
# on turn 7 it enchants the Grazer with Weakness (-2/-1), making it -2/2. On turn 10 Bot2 casts Wrath of God; in response Bot1 gives the Elves +3/+3
# with Giant Growth, so they die as a 4/4 beside the -2/2 Grazer. The token is 2/2 (4 + -2), not 4/4.

